WEBVTT

NOTE key=fd6d82ed6038f206

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.834
A little ant is very thirsty.

2
00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.995
She goes to the river for water.

3
00:00:04.495 --> 00:00:06.840
She falls in, and she can't swim.

4
00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.838
A dove in a tree sees her.

5
00:00:09.338 --> 00:00:11.160
The dove drops a leaf into the water.

6
00:00:11.660 --> 00:00:13.007
The ant gets on the leaf.

7
00:00:13.507 --> 00:00:15.190
Now she is safe on the grass.

8
00:00:15.690 --> 00:00:17.792
"Thank you, dove," she says. "You are kind."

9
00:00:18.292 --> 00:00:20.289
"Now we are friends," says the dove.
